id=hypercameramod_plugin
name=HyperCameraMod (Madrid plugin port)
version=0.1.0
versionCode=1
author=rezikham
description=EXPERIMENTAL, separate from the LUT module. Overlays the Madrid 6.8 jpegrAggr/heifedit plugins with a private libhcm_* dependency namespace. Requires a KernelSU metamodule with /odm overlay support. Does not touch the LUT module or install the APK.
